'''Red Fire''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by completing all of the challenges during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is red that fades into a lighter shade with a fire texture imprinted over it, hence the name. The guard is red, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
* It has a green variant under the name [[Green Fire]].

